 added."},"defenceVal":"4","price":"2200","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}}],"family":{"father":{"label":{"zh":"父亲","en":"Father"},"people":[{"id":"WJ1048515","code":"0"}]},"family":{"label":{"zh":"亲属","en":"Relatives"},"people":[{"id":"WJ1048815","code":"100"},{"id":"WJ1048915","code":"100"},{"id":"WJ1049015","code":"100"},{"id":"WJ1048615","code":"100"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI113215","name":{"zh":"巴郡氐李氏","en":"The Di Li clan of Ba Commandery"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自巴氐（賨人），本为生活在川西宕渠的板楯蛮。东汉末张鲁于汉中建立政权时，李特曾祖父移入汉中。曹操平定汉中后，李虎（李特祖父）率族人北上，定居略阳北土，复号巴氐，成为十六国时期成汉政权的奠基者。李特于西晋末年率流民起义，其子李雄建立成汉，是十六国中最早建立的国家。","en":"Originating from the Ba-Di (Cong people), originally the Banshun Man living in Dangqu of western Sichuan. In the late Eastern Han, when Zhang Lu established his regime in Hanzhong, Li Te's great-grandfather relocated to Hanzhong. After Cao Cao pacified Hanzhong, Li Hu (Li Te's grandfather) led the kinsmen North to settle in the northern lands of Lueyang, reclaiming the name Ba-Di and becoming the founders of the Cheng-Han regime during the Sixteen Kingdoms period. Li Te led an uprising of displaced refugees in the late Western Jin, and his son Li Xiong founded Cheng-Han, the earliest established state among the Sixteen Kingdoms."},"talent":{"military":"8","commerce":"5","politics":"7"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1073","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[78,72,55,45,75,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1300","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10018","armor":"WP1005605","helmet":"WP1019905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS107